    "name": "Rorschach Plus",
    "steam_appid": 1499210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499210/extras/92c48dbc521845a62206668c556766ad.avif?t=1688767420\" /></div><br><br><strong>Rorschach Plus is a precise, experimental puzzle platformer where you use paint to reveal your surroundings.</strong> Platforming through the levels is only half the challenge, the other is figuring out exactly what you're platforming <i>through</i>. Originally conceived by WhyCardBoard as a submission for a game jam in 2019, the game has been redesigned, refined, and tweaked into the version it is today.<br><br><strong>Here's what you need to know. Rorschach Plus has:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>more than 70 puzzle-platforming challenges to conquer<br></li><li>14 fresh achievements<br></li><li>a funky chiptune soundtrack by Rolemusic<br></li><li>the same creator who made &quot;Crate Succ,&quot; so you know it's gotta be good<br></li><li>an achievement for cheating<br></li><li>a concept entirely based on an idea that I stole from one of the funny little people in my phone</li></ul><br><i>&quot;You know Fortnite? This is that, but better.&quot;</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1499210/extras/92c48dbc521845a62206668c556766ad.avif?t=1688767420\" /></div><br><br><strong>Rorschach Plus is a precise, experimental puzzle platformer where you use paint to reveal your surroundings.</strong> Platforming through the levels is only half the challenge, the other is figuring out exactly what you're platforming <i>through</i>. Originally conceived by WhyCardBoard as a submission for a game jam in 2019, the game has been redesigned, refined, and tweaked into the version it is today.<br><br><strong>Here's what you need to know. Rorschach Plus has:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>more than 70 puzzle-platforming challenges to conquer<br></li><li>14 fresh achievements<br></li><li>a funky chiptune soundtrack by Rolemusic<br></li><li>the same creator who made &quot;Crate Succ,&quot; so you know it's gotta be good<br></li><li>an achievement for cheating<br></li><li>a concept entirely based on an idea that I stole from one of the funny little people in my phone</li></ul><br><i>&quot;You know Fortnite? This is that, but better.&quot;</i>",
